@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam ActivityBackgroundColor #F7F9FC
skinparam ActivityBorderColor #4A6FA5
title From requested intent to physical evidence (E05 last row)

start
:Requested intent\n(<- connections)\npump=true, valve=false;
:Output constraints\nrequire pump => valve;
:Safe intent\n("final output" in this chapter)\npump=false, valve=false;
note right
  Constraints only lower
  true to false. The runtime
  never turns the valve on
  to satisfy the rule.
end note
:Applied\n(renderer evidence:\ncommand was written);
:Confirmed\n(feedback evidence:\nlimit, encoder, ...);
note right
  Applied and confirmed are
  outside the language's
  output intent. Safe=true
  does not prove the pump ran.
end note
stop
@enduml
